# Invite links are minted as https://heybindle.com/invite/<token>.
#
# The destination is deliberately NOT named invite.html. A file at that name claims the
# /invite asset route, and Pages' asset normalization then 308-redirects /invite/<token>
# down to /invite — stripping the token before the page can read it. Verified live
# 2026-09-06. Keeping the name off the /invite prefix leaves the rewrite unshadowed.
#
# Status 200 rewrites rather than redirects, so the token stays in the address bar for
# the page script to read off the path.
/invite/* /vault-invite.html 200
/invite /vault-invite.html 200
